        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795327751/cycling-bot/efcb56eb6d-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "The Maryland Cycling Classic has been cancelled after five years on the calendar.\n\nCyclingUpToDate describes the news as a big hit for cycling in the USA. The report we have so far gives no further detail, so reasons and any future plans for the event are not yet clear.\n\nWhat would it take for more major road races to thrive in the US?\n\nSource: CyclingUpToDate.com\n\n#MarylandCyclingClassic #CyclingNews #ProCycling #RoadCycling #USCycling #WorldTour #CyclingCalendar #RaceNews",
