      "headline": "Delio Fernández Cruz banned four years in passport case",
      "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE5pbWZhdU40U3NpbzRoc0xDZ1hPYThfMmpCcURsajRxdkhabjkzb3pwMF9BMGI3Qk8xLTJRckd0U0pxMTM2ZVhkS1RSeWZwMTdwWXNRLWs3blp3RmZOTzNaeElBbWxYU1NxcmQ4MTVJTQ?oc=5",
      "source": "Velora Cycling",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795334953/cycling-bot/c180b73a55-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795334953/cycling-bot/c180b73a55-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "Four-year ban for Spanish rider Delio Fernández Cruz.\n\nA UCI tribunal has reportedly suspended him for four years in a case tied to the biological passport, according to Velora Cycling. Details such as his team, the start date of the ban and any right of appeal were not available in the report we have seen.\n\nWe'll update as soon as more information is confirmed.\n\nShould biological passport cases be resolved faster?\n\nSource: Velora Cycling\n\n#cycling #procycling #roadcycling #UCI #WorldTour #cyclingnews #antidoping #biologicalpassport #cyclingnewstoday #peloton",
      "alt_text": "News graphic with the headline that Spanish rider Delio Fernández Cruz has been banned for four years by a UCI tribunal in a biological passport case.",
      "score": 5,
      "reel_url": null,
      "category": "UCI",
